# A backstop, because the list above is exact filenames and that failed once:
# arisehub-agent-key.txt was created beside town.mjs before it was listed here,
# so for a while a live AriseHub key sat in a working tree that villagers run
# `git add` in. Any future credential dropped here is covered by shape now,
# whether or not anyone remembers to add its name.
*-key.txt
*-token.txt
*-key.json
*.key
town-state.json
town-state.json.tmp
